        "heading": "<em>How</em> to Measure Ring Size",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text_highlight": "serif",
        "text": "<p>For precise sizing, we recommend a ring mandrel—a tapered rod marked with sizes—to measure an existing ring worn on the same finger. Alternatively, a finger-sizing tool, typically a set of graduated rings, can be used directly on the finger to determine the ideal size. </p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": "https://www.amazon.com/s?k=finger+sizer&crid=1Z99ZEY4UMMEZ&sprefix=finger+sizer%2Caps%2C299&ref=nb_sb_noss_1"
      }
    },
    "media_text_CLgjbP": {
      "type": "media-text",
      "blocks": {
        "image_9i4VBb": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ring_size_guide.jpg"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_9i4VBb"
      ],
      "name": "t:labels.media_with_text",
      "settings": {
        "media_width": "50",
        "media_crop": "none",
        "layout": "left",
        "content_alignment": "left",
        "content_position": "center",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "top_padding": false,
        "bottom_padding": false,
        "full_width": true,
        "subheading": "",
        "heading": "Make Your <em>Own</em> Ring Sizer",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text_highlight": "serif",
        "text": "<p>For the most accurate results, we recommend professional sizing whenever possible—but this method offers a helpful starting point from the comfort of home.</p><ol><li>Cut a piece of string, floss, thin paper, or yarn at least 3 inches in length.</li><li>Gently wrap it around the base of your finger for a comfortable yet snug fit. </li><li>Mark where the end of the string overlaps.</li><li>Lay the string flat and measure from the end to your mark using a rule. </li></ol>",
        "button_text": "SHOP RING SIZERS",
        "button_link": "https://www.amazon.com/s?k=finger+sizer&crid=1Z99ZEY4UMMEZ&sprefix=finger+sizer%2Caps%2C299&ref=nb_sb_noss_1"
      }
    },
