            "text": "<p>18 KARATS uses universally recognized US sizes for our rings and wedding bands. The chart below matches US sizes with inside finger circumference and equivalents in international sizing. For quarter-size increments, we recommend using the UK sizing<strong> </strong>option through our Ring Builder. For any questions about sizing, contact us—we’re here to help! </p>"
